# {{project_name}} architecture

Parent: [Documentation index](README.md)

This repository owns one product workspace with multiple runtime components.
`workspace.toml` is the executable component inventory.

## Ownership

The repository root owns Git history, policy, documentation, editor settings,
CI and cross-component orchestration. Each directory below `apps/` owns one
runtime, its dependencies, source code, tests and profile-specific tooling.

Components may depend on explicit contracts, but they must not reach into
another component's private source tree merely because both live in one
repository.

## Git boundary

There is exactly one `.git` directory at the repository root. Components never
contain nested repositories or submodules. A component can later be extracted
with a history-filtering tool using its `apps/<name>/` path.
